ailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/b342a3c5bf7d3f52de40a9cb15527e43.avif?t=1773248029\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras_big/b342a3c5bf7d3f52de40a9cb15527e43.webp?t=1773248029 width=1560 height=778 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, employeen! You just joined &amp;Beyond, the only delivery company bold enough to leave the job description blank. You wanted benefits? You got 'em. You wanted details? Too bad. Now grab your next delivery contract and get to work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/b60eca148b13362d5109a52bc6b16e78.poster.avif?t=1773248029\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/b60eca148b13362d5109a52bc6b16e78.webm?t=1773248029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROP SURF (It's not a bug, it's a feature)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bridges? Too slow. Ladders? For cowards. With PhysTech's <u><i>Prop Surfing</i></u><i> System</i>, every random piece of junk becomes a high-speed launch vehicle. File cabinets, barrels, office chairs... If you can stand on it, you can surf it straight across the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/959d194d97c1927dfba66740d0a0f2f1.poster.avif?t=1773248029\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/959d194d97c1927dfba66740d0a0f2f1.webm?t=1773248029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCRAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scrap first, ask questions later. Anything that isn't nailed down is raw material: Tables, chairs, electronics, junk...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/9b3411ce53981278a5b476a29e10a5b2.poster.avif?t=1773248029\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/9b3411ce53981278a5b476a29e10a5b2.webm?t=1773248029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DELIVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw scrap in, pull out a delivery. <u>Delivery Maker 3000</u> doesn't ask questions... and neither do we. Get it done, pay off your debt... or don't, and find out how much we <i>love</i> failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/cf22598a497cf4cd9e993dc1fc78694d.poster.avif?t=1773248029\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/extras/cf22598a497cf4cd9e993dc1fc78694d.webm?t=1773248029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["FailCake (HyenaQuest)"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376480/6995eea8465b23c205d348bd0f23c41800457b3e/header.jpg?t=1